  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with the boiling water.\n• Rinse and drain white rice.\n• Add rice and a pinch of salt and cook, uncovered, over high heat until tender, 12-14 minutes. Drain, rinse with warm water and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-673fd5b21355715564e0efa7-2df33a45.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, grate carrot. Drain sweetcorn. Roughly chop baby spinach leaves. Drain and rinse black beans.\n• In a medium bowl, add sweetcorn, spinach and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper and set aside.\n• Roughly chop pickled jalapeños.\n• In a small bowl combine tomato salsa and jalapeños.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-673fd5b21355715564e0efa7-e4d45d85.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Add carrot and black beans and cook, stirring, until softened, 2-3 minutes.\n• SPICY! This spice blend is hot! Add less if you're sensitive to heat. Stir in tomato paste and Mexican Fiesta spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Reduce heat to medium, then add the water and butter and cook, stirring, until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-673fd5b21355715564e0efa7-7505bfc1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rapid rice, Mexican black beans and spinach salsa between bowls.\n• Sprinkle over Cheddar cheese.\n• Top with light sour cream and garnish with chilli flakes (if using) to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-673fd5b21355715564e0efa7-0aff74a3.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
